      "raw": "<p>So far we have gotten two similar hints about the Slaughter House Six, a glimpse in the <a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/system/files/downloads/Villain%20Challenge%20Mode.pdf\">Challenges document</a> and an <a href=\"https://twitter.com/GtGAdam/status/560457453608132608\">artwork tweet </a>from Adam. But I&#39;m very curious about where they are going to show up.</p><p>Ambuscade is certainly going to be returning in <em>Villains of the Multiverse</em>, but what about the other five members? The glowing orange guy, the Radioactivist, has already appeared in Proletariat&#39;s deck. That pretty much rules him showing up in Ambuscade&#39;s V5-style deck otherwise you could potentially have two Radioactivists out at the same time.</p><p>Does that mean Ambuscade and the rest of the Slaughter House Six will reappear in another incarnation post-<em>Villains</em>? That would be odd since then there would be three Ambuscade decks total, more than any other villain.</p><p>Where are these guys appearing? In Sentinel Tactics? The Mirror Woman (red and orange suit, orange hair, metal mask) is on the cover of the <em>For Profit</em> expansion. Maybe they will only show up in Tactics as a fully fledged team.</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Do you think we will we ever get to fight a Slaughter House Six team in SOTM?</span></p>",
